m Dance checks cause your attacks to combo on a natural 19-20 until the start of your next turn.","prerequisites":"Dual Wield I","automation":{"type":"manual","automated":false},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"frequency":"see description"},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"fe64c8bc1821a9c9","name":"Dual Weapon Flourish II","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BRD/The_Wanderer's_Minuet.webp","system":{"className":"Blade Dancer","tree":"Dervish","description":"The tempo quickens, every movement a seamless duet of steel. While dual wielding, your Perform Dance checks now cause your attacks to combo on a natural 18-20 until the start of your next turn.","prerequisites":"Dual Wield I, Dual Wield II, Dual Weapon Flourish I","automation":{"type":"manual","automated":false},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"frequency":"see description"},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"84067efc37eba9e1","name":"Presto","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BRD/The_Wanderer's_Minuet.webp","system":{"className":"Bard","tree":"Dancer","description":"Once per encounter, reroll a Perform (Dance) check. Summary only: consult the rulebook for exact wording, usage limits, and prerequisites.","prerequisites":"See the rulebook for prerequisites.","automation":{"mode":"manual","reason":"Conditional, triggered, or usage-limited effect; adjudicate using the rulebook."},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"value":0,"max":0},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"d7413cc41d24fbb3","name":"Samba","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BRD/The_Wanderer's_Minuet.webp","system":{"className":"Bard","tree":"Dancer","description":"A dance performance can increase melee damage for the turn. Summary only: consult the rulebook for exact wording, usage limits, and prerequisites.","prerequisites":"See the rulebook for prerequisites.","automation":{"mode":"manual","reason":"Conditional, triggered, or usage-limited effect; adjudicate using the rulebook."},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"value":0,"max":0},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"15b6906fd5597459","name":"Weapon Specialization (swords)","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRK/Blood_Weapon.webp","system":{"className":"Warrior","tree":"Fighter","description":"Choose a proficient weapon group and reroll one attack per encounter with it. Summary only: consult the rulebook for exact wording, usage limits, and prerequisites.","prerequisites":"See the rulebook for prerequisites.","automation":{"mode":"manual","reason":"Conditional, triggered, or usage-limited effect; adjudicate using the rulebook."},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"value":0,"max":0},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"45eebc478364a449","name":"Armour Proficiency (light)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/SMN/Searing_Light.webp","system":{"description":"","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"f2c548118166dd0b","name":"Bardic Study","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BRD/The_Wanderer's_Minuet.webp","system":{"description":"Learn performances from scores, up to 1 + Intelligence modifier. Each copy adds another 1 + Intelligence modifier slots. New slots are granted retroactively when the Intelligence modifier increases.","prerequisites":{"anySkills":["perform"]},"repeatable":true,"effects":{"performanceSlotsPerCopy":1},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"fbfffd2b818ec76a","name":"Dodge","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/NIN/Trick_Attack.webp","system":{"description":"Once per turn as a reaction in light or no armour, make an Acrobatics check to avoid a successful attack. If the check beats the attack roll, treat the attack as not beating your Reflex Defence.","prerequisites":{"attributes":{"agi":13}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"3069650905e2f6d8","name":"Dual Wield I","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/Life_of_the_Dragon.webp","system":{"description":"Reduce the penalty for attacking with two weapons from -10 to -5.","prerequisites":{"attributes":{"agi":15}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"fcb86a249175063e","name":"Dual Wield II","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/Life_of_the_Dragon.webp","system":{"description":"Reduce the two-weapon attack penalty from -5 to -2.","prerequisites":{"attributes":{"agi":17},"characterLevel":6,"technicks":["Dual Wield I"]},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"1775b06b1c9cad0e","name":"Improved Initiative","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/BattleLitanyBuff.webp","system":{"description":"Improve your initiative die by one step (d12 to d10, d10 to d8, d8 to d6, d6 to d4, d4 to d3). It cannot improve beyond d3.","repeatable":true,"effects":{"initiativeStep":1},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"ac66307985990100","name":"Skill Focus (acrobatics, light weapon, perform dance)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRK/Blood_Weapon.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a trained skill and gain +5 to its checks. Each additional copy must apply to a different trained skill.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"trainedSkill"},"effects":{"selectedSkillBonus":5},"selectedSkill":"acrobatics, light weapon, perform dance","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"e0cfd868800694e7","name":"Weapon Finesse","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WAR/Inner_Strength.webp","system":{"description":"Use Agility instead of Strength when calculating damage with light weapons, thrown weapons, unarmed attacks, and natural attacks.","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"09ff74a0b9c329ff","name":"Weapon Proficiency (axes, bludgeons, crossbows, knives, swords)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/ROLE-MELEE/Bloodbath.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a weapon group and ignore the -5 penalty on checks with its weapons. Each additional copy must select a different group.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"weaponGroup","options":["axes","bows","bludgeons","crossbows","knives","polearms","staves","swords"]},"effects":{"weaponProficiency":true},"selectedWeaponGroup":"axes, bludgeons, crossbows, knives, swords","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"1831e678307d6546","name":"War Dance","type":"feature","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BRD/Army's_Paeon.webp","system":{"category":"Class Feature","description":"No defensive-performance penalty for Perform Dance."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"d5e57da3f3d2a5c2","name":"Dosado +1","type":"feature","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/BattleLitanyBuff.webp","system":{"category":"Class Feature","description":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"cde201e4513f0384","name":"Mourning Elegy","type":"performance","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BRD/Army's_Paeon.webp","system":{"action":"Perform check","targetSide":"enemy","description":"A bleak verse weakens a foe's Fortitude Defence if it fails to resist.","specialRules":"Mind effect.","automation":{"skill":"perform","minimumDC":0,"effects":[{"type":"debuff","defence":"fort","value":-5,"resistBy":"will"}]}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"2c546e3c5a0cf3cd","name":"Vagrant's Threnody","type":"performance","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/generic/auto-attack.webp","system":{"action":"Perform check","targetSide":"enemy","description":"A disheartening verse reduces a foe's attack and skill checks if it fails to resist.","specialRules":"Mind effect.","automation":{"skill":"perform","minimumDC":0,"effects":[{"type":"debuff","defence":"attacksAndSkills","value":-2,"resistBy":"will"}]}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"a5805d7b2ee11888","name":"Agate Ring","type":"equipment","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WHM/Stone_II.webp","system":{"category":"Accessories","description":"A large agate stone set in a thick adamantite band. The ring symbolizes steadfast defiance. You gain immunity to stuns.","cost":4400,"availability":"Exotic","bulk":0.1,"equipSlot":"Finger","equippable":true,"specialRules":"A large agate stone set in a thick adamantite band. The ring symbolizes steadfast defiance. You gain immunity to stuns.","itemEffects":{"immunities":["stuns"]}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"05406aa53af2723d","name":"Amethyst Armlet","type":"equipment","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/ROLE-RANGED/Sleep.webp","system":{"category":"Accessories","description":"It is said that some oneirocritics can use amethyst stones to enter a dreamlike state without falling into a true slumber. You gain immunity to sleep.","cost":600,"availability":"Uncommon","bulk":0.1,"equipSlot":"Wrist","equippable":true,"specialRules":"It is said that some oneirocritics can use amethyst stones to enter a dreamlike state without falling into a true slumber. You gain immunity to sleep.","itemEffects":{"immunities":["sleep"]}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"69fdf7288d0fb66e","name":"Mythril Shirt","type":"armor","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Sheltron.webp","system":{"category":"Light Armour","description":"A chain shirt fashioned from mythril links. It is far lighter than other armour, while still offering a great deal of protection.","cost":7900,"availability":"Exotic","bulk":2,"armorType":"light","reflexBonus":2,"damageReduction":9,"maxAgilityBonus":4,"armorCheckPenalty":-5,"specialRules":"A chain shirt fashioned from mythril links. It is far lighter than other armour, while still offering a great deal of protection.","equipped":true},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
