,"tree":"Occultist","description":"A black spell that worsens a foe's Break Gauge can push it an additional step. Summary only: consult the rulebook for exact wording, usage limits, and prerequisites.","prerequisites":"See the rulebook for prerequisites.","automation":{"mode":"manual","reason":"Conditional, triggered, or usage-limited effect; adjudicate using the rulebook."},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"value":0,"max":0},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"90d81e3ce24eabab","name":"Dark Renewal","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/Life_of_the_Dragon.webp","system":{"className":"Initiate","tree":"Occultist","description":"Once per encounter, recover resources after moving a foe down the Break Gauge. Summary only: consult the rulebook for exact wording, usage limits, and prerequisites.","prerequisites":"See the rulebook for prerequisites.","automation":{"mode":"manual","reason":"Conditional, triggered, or usage-limited effect; adjudicate using the rulebook."},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"value":0,"max":0},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"52f7ef8c5f373690","name":"Summon Darkness","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/SMN/Summon_Bahamut.webp","system":{"className":"Initiate","tree":"Occultist","description":"Summon an undead or infernal creature ally by spending mana. Summary only: consult the rulebook for exact wording, usage limits, and prerequisites.","prerequisites":"See the rulebook for prerequisites.","automation":{"mode":"manual","reason":"Conditional, triggered, or usage-limited effect; adjudicate using the rulebook."},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"value":0,"max":0},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"c5b1f7b653a9ddd3","name":"Arcane Study (2)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BLM/Enochian.webp","system":{"description":"Learn spells from scrolls, up to 1 + Intelligence modifier. Each copy adds another 1 + Intelligence modifier slots (minimum 1).","prerequisites":{"skills":["spellcraft"]},"repeatable":true,"effects":{"spellSlotsPerCopy":1},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"9e64cdf7d21316d0","name":"Armour Proficiency (mystic)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Bulwark.webp","system":{"description":"","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"9ff65377bf09c1c3","name":"Channel","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BRD/The_Wanderer's_Minuet.webp","system":{"description":"Once per day while at or below half MP, spend a minor action to restore the greater of your Mind score or one quarter of maximum MP. Usable no more than once per encounter.","prerequisites":{"skills":["spellcraft"]},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"be4aef8483cb74ec","name":"Combat Casting","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Bulwark.webp","system":{"description":"When casting defensively while threatened by multiple enemies, take only one -5 penalty.","prerequisites":{"skills":["spellcraft"]},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"0a0fd6585bc8cf76","name":"HP Up","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WAR/Thrill_of_Battle.webp","system":{"description":"Increase maximum HP by 5 + your character level.","effects":{"resources":{"hpMaxFlat":5,"hpMaxPerLevel":1}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"c305dee9db45bb25","name":"MP Up","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/BLM/Manafont.webp","system":{"description":"Increase maximum MP by 5 + your character level.","prerequisites":{"skills":["spellcraft"]},"effects":{"resources":{"mpMaxFlat":5,"mpMaxPerLevel":1}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"2062d9ccf7f0128e","name":"Shield Proficiency","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Shield_Bash.webp","system":{"description":"Ignore the -5 penalty for using shields and reduce cumulative block penalties to -5.","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"cd41d278cae2a14d","name":"Skill Focus (persuasion, spellcraft)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/AST/Gravity.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a trained skill and gain +5 to its checks. Each additional copy must apply to a different trained skill.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"trainedSkill"},"effects":{"selectedSkillBonus":5},"selectedSkill":"persuasion, spellcraft","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"2149cb6d220d0c0e","name":"Weapon Proficiency (knives, staves)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/ROLE-MELEE/Bloodbath.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a weapon group and ignore the -5 penalty on checks with its weapons. Each additional copy must select a different group.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"weaponGroup","options":["axes","bows","bludgeons","crossbows","knives","polearms","staves","swords"]},"effects":{"weaponProficiency":true},"selectedWeaponGroup":"knives, staves","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"65e028c5d06c49f3","name":"Darkness","type":"spell","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRK/Darkside.webp","system":{"school":"Black Magick","mpCost":6,"action":"Primary Action","target":"One creature within 12 squares and line of sight","targetMode":"selected","checkSkill":"spellcraft","description":"Magickal shadow blinds a creature.","specialRules":"Targets of a higher level gain +5 to the relevant defence.","higherLevelDefenceBonus":5,"automation":{"minimumDC":0,"effects":[{"type":"condition","status":"blinded","defence":"fort","durationRounds":0}]}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"21a57380a3d73d25","name":"Dispel","type":"spell","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/ROLE-HEALER/Esuna.webp","system":{"school":"White Magick","mpCost":10,"action":"Primary Action","target":"You or one creature within 12 squares and line of sight","targetMode":"self-or-selected","checkSkill":"spellcraft","description":"Ends dispellable magickal effects on the target.","specialRules":"When targeting an ally, treat Will Defence as 5 lower. Removes spell effects marked dispellable if the check beats Will Defence.","higherLevelDefenceBonus":0,"automation":{"minimumDC":0,"effects":[{"type":"dispel"}]}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"ccdfcd6793e1ac34","name":"Maim","type":"spell","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRK/Bloodspiller.webp","system":{"school":"Black Magick","mpCost":10,"action":"Primary Action","target":"One creature within 6 squares and line of sight","targetMode":"selected","checkSkill":"spellcraft","description":"A severe burst of dark energy inflicts damage.","specialRules":"Each explosive damage die creates two extra dice. If this spell moves the target down the Break Gauge, the condition persists until intensive care or magickal healing restores a step.","higherLevelDefenceBonus":0,"automation":{"minimumDC":0,"effects":[{"type":"damage","formula":"4d6","damageType":"dark","defence":"fort","halfOnFailure":false}]}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"07f3e759a87a587a","name":"Muddle","type":"spell","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/NIN/Trick_Attack.webp","system":{"school":"Blue Magick","mpCost":16,"action":"Primary Action","target":"One creature within 12 squares and line of sight","targetMode":"selected","checkSkill":"spellcraft","description":"Confuses a foe and disrupts its ability to distinguish friend from enemy.","specialRules":"Higher-level targets gain +5 to Will Defence. Mind effect.","higherLevelDefenceBonus":5,"automation":{"minimumDC":0,"effects":[{"type":"condition","status":"confused","defence":"will","durationRounds":0}]}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"657fbe117e2521c0","name":"Bone Wand","type":"weapon","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/generic/auto-attack.webp","system":{"category":"Staves","description":"This dark wand was crafted from the cursed bone of an ancient revenant. When you cast a black magick spell that deals dark damage, it deals +1 die of damage.","cost":3100,"availability":"Rare","bulk":0.1,"weaponGroup":"staves","weaponSize":"Small","weaponSkill":"spellcraft","attack":{"bonus":2},"damage":{"formula":"3d4+2","type":"Dark"},"range":"Ranged","capacity":0,"specialRules":"This dark wand was crafted from the cursed bone of an ancient revenant. When you cast a black magick spell that deals dark damage, it deals +1 die of damage.","equipped":true},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"9ad6bd461abe5717","name":"Sorcerer’s Kaftan","type":"armor","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Sheltron.webp","system":{"category":"Mystic Armour","description":"Mystic armour; damage reduction and armour check penalty are recorded.","cost":2700,"availability":"Uncommon","bulk":1,"armorType":"mystic","damageReduction":6,"armorCheckPenalty":-2,"specialRules":"Dark robes, oft seen on acolytes of the infernals. You gain a +2 bonus to Spellcraft checks made to cast black 