e,"uses":{"frequency":"see description"},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"a142b1b11ec526cc","name":"Armour Training","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/AST/The_Arrow.webp","system":{"className":"Warrior","tree":"Fighter","description":"Improve the Agility limit of light armour and reduce heavy-armour encumbrance. Summary only: consult the rulebook for exact wording, usage limits, and prerequisites.","prerequisites":"See the rulebook for prerequisites.","automation":{"mode":"manual","reason":"Conditional, triggered, or usage-limited effect; adjudicate using the rulebook."},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"value":0,"max":0},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"836a3725e87a826c","name":"Dark Harvest","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/Life_of_the_Dragon.webp","system":{"className":"Fell Knight","tree":"Reaver","description":"The more foes that gather, the more power you draw from them. Once per encounter, you may target up to 3 creatures with your Abyssal Drain talent. However, you only gain an amount of HP equal to half the total damage dealt.","prerequisites":"Abyssal Drain I, Abyssal Drain II","automation":{"type":"manual","automated":false},"repeatable":false,"uses":{"frequency":"see description"},"category":"Talent"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"d168f5736d83e2c2","name":"Dark Renewal","type":"talent","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/DRG/Life_of_the_Dragon.webp","system":{"className":"Initiate","tree":"Occultist","description":"Once per encounter, recover resources after moving a foe down the Break Gauge. Summary only: consult the rulebook for exact wording, usage limits, and prerequisites.","prerequisites":"See the rulebook for prerequisites.","automation":{"mode":"manual","reason":"Conditional, 