, choose a penalty up to -1 on melee attacks and gain the same bonus to melee damage until your next turn. The limit increases by 1 at character level 4 and every 4 levels thereafter, to -5/+5; two-handed weapons double the damage bonus.","prerequisites":{"attributes":{"str":13}},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"6c16d48c1b33d403","name":"Shield Bash","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Shield_Bash.webp","system":{"description":"Make counterattacks with a shield, dealing damage based on shield size. If the attack beats both Reflex and Fortitude Defence, disrupt and end the triggering action; shield bash adds to cumulative block penalties.","prerequisites":{"technicks":["Shield Proficiency"]},"category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"f7fd9176d25894ab","name":"Shield Proficiency","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Shield_Bash.webp","system":{"description":"Ignore the -5 penalty for using shields and reduce cumulative block penalties to -5.","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"4b3ff526a63e3b10","name":"Weapon Proficiency (axes)","type":"technick","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/ROLE-MELEE/Bloodbath.webp","system":{"description":"Choose a weapon group and ignore the -5 penalty on checks with its weapons. Each additional copy must select a different group.","repeatable":true,"choice":{"type":"weaponGroup","options":["axes","bows","bludgeons","crossbows","knives","polearms","staves","swords"]},"effects":{"weaponProficiency":true},"selectedWeaponGroup":"axes","category":"Technick"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"426072a4c2f53dea","name":"Hide Armour","type":"armor","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Sheltron.webp","system":{"category":"Heavy Armour","description":"Layers of tanned hide threaded together to form a simple suit of armour.","cost":500,"availability":"Common","bulk":3,"armorType":"heavy","reflexBonus":3,"damageReduction":3,"maxAgilityBonus":3,"armorCheckPenalty":-10,"specialRules":"Layers of tanned hide threaded together to form a simple suit of armour.","equipped":true},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"64575d299a486e8c","name":"Orcish Madu","type":"armor","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/PLD/Sheltron.webp","system":{"category":"Shields","description":"Though tiny, this round shield is fitted with large horns or tusks. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield deals +1 die of damage. Additionally, this shield deals piercing damage rather than blunt damage. Medium creatures may treat this as either a 1-handed or light shield.","cost":1300,"availability":"Common","weaponSize":"Tiny","weaponSkill":"light-weapon","attack":{"bonus":1},"damage":{"formula":"","type":"Blunt"},"armorType":"shield","bulk":0.1,"specialRules":"Though tiny, this round shield is fitted with large horns or tusks. When using the Shield Bash technick, this shield deals +1 die of damage. Additionally, this shield deals piercing damage rather than blunt damage. Medium creatures may treat this as either a 1-handed or light shield.","equipped":true},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}},{"_id":"953805afcd0b0bdf","name":"Orcish Tabar","type":"weapon","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WAR/Heavy_Swing.webp","system":{"category":"Axes","description":"Used primarily by the Orcs, who favour large, powerful swings. While wielded in one hand, medium creatures double the damage bonus of the Mighty Strikes technick.","cost":3100,"availability":"Common","bulk":1,"weaponGroup":"axes","weaponSize":"Medium","weaponSkill":"one-handed","attack":{"bonus":1},"damage":{"formula":"2d8+1","type":"Slashing"},"range":"Melee","capacity":0,"specialRules":"Used primarily by the Orcs, who favour large, powerful swings. While wielded in one hand, medium creatures double the damage bonus of the Mighty Strikes technick.","equipped":true},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
